TCSlib/Cryptography/Pairing/MatrixDH/ColumnLaws.lean:199:6: error: Tactic `rewrite` failed: Did not find an occurrence of the pattern
  uprob fun xs => ∀ (i : ?m.849), ?p (xs i)
